# Local secrets for `pnpm dev` and `pnpm preview`. Copy to .dev.vars (not
# committed) and fill in only what you need.

# Resend API key. Used only when EMAIL_TRANSPORT is "resend"; the default
# "capture" transport logs emails instead of sending them. To try real
# sending locally, also override EMAIL_TRANSPORT and EMAIL_FROM here.
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
# EMAIL_TRANSPORT=resend
# EMAIL_FROM=Kotivalo <noreply@your-verified-domain>
